时扭曲重组的街区，由执念拼成的心像世界，多重重力，在二维和三维之间穿梭，还有完整的战斗系统与多阶段Boss战。\n \n游戏仍处于开发阶段，所展示内容不代表最终品质。\n \n______", "state": 0, "duration": 5977, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 397951022, "name": "人间异想计划", "face": "https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/2c23feeec82aaabf5244231980f37771ed59c6bf.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 117471667291896, "view": 1714584, "danmaku": 2169, "reply": 2254, "favorite": 8319, "coin": 4796, "share": 7807, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 92, "like": 31550, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 1714584, "fav_g": 0, "like_g": 145}, "dynamic": "#人间异想计划# #人间异想计划首曝# #宇宙小狗工作室#\n\n欢迎来到「异乐都」！一年一度的「怪谈一日」游行即将开始，老板请就位执勤~\n由宇宙小狗工作室研发，轻怪谈都市异想开放世界RPG《人间异想计划》现已开启预约。关注官方账号@人间异想计划  ，了解更多游戏相关资讯~", "cid": 42887679874, "dimension": {"width": 3840, "height": 2160, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV1Ranw6DEYW", "first_frame": "http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_000013nk5s59v10el2mhs4shwx4k56b_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "上海", "cover43": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b213cd2e3ea1f26c082aa52ff4b84f23a0068874.jpg", "tidv2": 2079, "tnamev2": "其他游戏", "pid_v2": 1008, "pid_name_v2": "游戏", "attribute_v3": 4, "current_state": 0, "global_state": 0, "bvid": "BV1Ranw6DEYW", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "百万播放", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 117472741165711, "videos": 1, "tid": 31, "tname": "翻唱", "copyright": 3, "pic": "http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6e7a970e4f679969853d80f8154b6ccb3d3a5b48.jpg", "title": "《南屏晚钟》来啦！", "pubdate": 1792491941, "ctime": 1792491941, "desc": "大家晚上好，今天唱《南屏晚钟》 。\n还没等到我回复的新朋友们不要伤心和失望呀！\n平时白天忙一些，晚上时间就充裕啦～\n吃完晚饭我来回大家评论哟！\n再次感谢每一位朋友老师们的支持和鼓励，爱大家！！", "state": 0, "duration": 97, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0